concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-torture-prohibition-and-death-penalty-abolition-act-2010-sch-1-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 December 1984."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "Note: The text of the Convention is set out in Australian Treaty Series 1989 No. 21 ([1989] ATS 21). In 2010, the text of a Convention in the Australian Treaty Series was accessible through the Australian Treaties Library on the AustLII website (www.austlii.edu.au).  (2) An expression that is used both in this Division and in the Convention (whether or not a particular meaning is given to it by the Convention) has, in this Division, the same meaning as it has in the Convention." ;
